   in those subtrees.

6. Elliptic-curve parameter files (`pymiracl/lib/`)
   Apache License 2.0 — see `pymiracl/lib/LICENSE`

If you use only a subset of this repository, you need only comply with the
licenses of the components you use. If you redistribute the repository as a
whole, you must satisfy all applicable component licenses, including AGPL-3.0
for pymiracl.

This software is intended for research and evaluation. See each component
